# Values stored as text, in columns and in the JSON above

AccessLevel: read_only ask edit full
ActorKind: device agent daemon
ApprovalDecision: accept acceptForSession decline cancel
AttachmentKind: image audio resource resource_link
ConfigOptionCategory: model mode model_config thought_level other
DeliveryKind: prompt message reply notice
DeliveryMode: queue steer
DeliveryState: queued sending delivered refused cancelled
EnvelopeKind: handoff message reply notice instructions
FileChangeKind: add update delete move
Hold: stoppedPerson stoppedAgent failed hops
ItemKind: user_message assistant_message reasoning command_execution file_change mcp_tool_call tool_call warning error web_search image_view image_generation context_compaction envelope request
ItemStatus: in_progress completed failed interrupted declined
OriginKind: user spawn native
OutputFormat: markdown
QuestionKind: text number integer choice
StartedBy: delivery provider found
StopReason: max_tokens max_turn_requests refusal
ToolAction: read search
TurnState: running completed failed interrupted
WakeMode: settled needsInput

Not closed sets (IDs, or a type api/wire lists no values for): DeliveryID DeviceID InstanceID ParticipantID ThreadID TurnID
